{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.poster.avif?t=1772586141\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.webm?t=1772586141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.mp4?t=1772586141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this indie couch party game, use your own media to create a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a special memory or an inside joke, choose the best file to make the whole group laugh out loud!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>3 to 6 players:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2 to 5 of your friends in hilarious multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Over 20 scenario:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 unique, hand-drawn cartoony backgrounds \u2014 with more on the way! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Use any device as your controller:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smartphone, tablet, laptop... anything with a browser works! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Supports 4 types of media:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photos, drawings, videos, or text \u2014 send files directly from your device to build the most unique and unexpected scripts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Unlimited replayability:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless combinations of files, scenarios, players, and laughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Multiple Languages:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, French, and more to come! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958650?t=1772586141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958650?t=1772586141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/5e3561872618ee7be8465dfd124e3ef40283489a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772586141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/5e3561872618ee7be8465dfd124e3ef40283489a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772586141","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.poster.avif?t=1772586141\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.webm?t=1772586141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/extras/cb575db7df33b074c66b5cd0e50e3da0.mp4?t=1772586141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this indie couch party game, use your own media to create a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a special memory or an inside joke, choose the best file to make the whole group laugh out loud!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>3 to 6 players:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2 to 5 of your friends in hilarious multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Over 20 scenario:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 unique, hand-drawn cartoony backgrounds \u2014 with more on the way! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Use any device as your controller:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smartphone, tablet, laptop... anything with a browser works! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Supports 4 types of media:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photos, drawings, videos, or text \u2014 send files directly from your device to build the most unique and unexpected scripts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Unlimited replayability:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless combinations of files, scenarios, players, and laughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Multiple Languages:</u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, French, and more to come! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio Pimbina"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958650/cb38317500d9951869862e04f38cd52a0bcc5ba6/header.jpg?t=1772586141","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958650/2068260777/82dd0047d57e8cbfeffc75c5ed434801381bcff4/1761786889/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761789723","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958650/2068260777/82dd0047d57e8cbfeffc75c5ed434801381bcff4/1761786889/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761789723","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958650/2068260777/82dd0047d57e8cbfeffc75c5ed434801381bc